WEBVTT

00:00:12.350 --> 00:00:15.980
Age... Why...

00:00:18.860 --> 00:00:21.360
I hear the Nodos left our ship?

00:00:21.440 --> 00:00:24.110
So the credit for all the
achievements on our journey

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:26.990
somehow goes to those
brothers, not the princess, huh?

00:00:28.030 --> 00:00:34.830
<b>Over and over again I wish on the dazzling star far away</b>

00:00:34.910 --> 00:00:41.090
<b>Wandering heartbeats, gravitation, the story of their attraction</b>

00:00:54.600 --> 00:01:01.270
<b>When did it begin? No one knows the end of it</b>

00:01:01.360 --> 00:01:08.320
<b>It's not a trick or an illusion, it's a current that I can't swim against</b>

00:01:08.410 --> 00:01:10.320
<b>(Dark!)</b>

00:01:10.410 --> 00:01:15.330
<b>The monster that lives in the darkness</b>

00:01:15.410 --> 00:01:17.290
<b>(Blight!)</b>

00:01:17.370 --> 00:01:20.710
<b>As if I were easily getting swallowed into it</b>

00:01:20.790 --> 00:01:22.340
<b>(I seek a hero!)</b>

00:01:22.420 --> 00:01:25.210
<b>I awake as I truly am</b>

00:01:25.300 --> 00:01:33.720
<b>If God says conflicts and life's old dreams go hand in hand</b>

00:01:33.810 --> 00:01:39.190
<b>I'm looking for you even if it means ripping my body apart</b>

00:01:39.270 --> 00:01:47.530
<b>With a flower held to my heart, no one can stop this heartbeat now that it's begun</b>

00:01:47.610 --> 00:01:52.240
<b>We're destined to come in contact</b>

00:01:59.120 --> 00:02:00.620
<b>I don't hear anything.</b>

00:02:00.710 --> 00:02:03.210
I wonder if she's meditating.

00:02:03.290 --> 00:02:08.380
Age is so cruel to make the
princess all depressed like this.

00:02:08.470 --> 00:02:11.800
She's locked herself in pretty much the
whole time since we left the port, you know?

00:02:11.890 --> 00:02:15.390
There are almost no usage
records on the food dispenser, either.

00:02:15.470 --> 00:02:16.970
I worry about her health.

00:02:17.060 --> 00:02:19.390
Don't say bad things about Age.

00:02:19.480 --> 00:02:20.850
But, Aneasha-sama...

00:02:20.940 --> 00:02:25.570
Do you really think that Age
just abandoned this ship and left?

00:02:28.650 --> 00:02:33.370
Age left this ship in order
to protect the princess.

00:02:33.450 --> 00:02:34.530
Protect her?

00:02:34.620 --> 00:02:38.950
Age is the Nodos. From now on, he's
going to be the first target of the enemy.

00:02:39.040 --> 00:02:42.580
That's why he decided to keep
his distance from the princess.

00:02:42.670 --> 00:02:44.500
At least, that's what I think.

00:02:44.590 --> 00:02:45.380
Oh, I see.

00:02:45.420 --> 00:02:47.880
Then he should just tell her that!

00:02:47.960 --> 00:02:50.670
Age is cruel after all!

00:02:50.760 --> 00:02:53.640
What's wrong with Age?

00:02:53.720 --> 00:02:55.930
It's time for your meal.

00:02:56.010 --> 00:03:02.520
Thank you. We're going to be very busy, so
we need to build up our physical strength.

00:03:02.600 --> 00:03:04.560
Just leave it right there, please.

00:03:04.650 --> 00:03:06.610
Yes, Dhianeila-sama.

00:03:12.490 --> 00:03:14.620
The princess seems to be fine.

00:03:14.700 --> 00:03:17.780
I wonder when she got over the whole thing.

00:03:17.870 --> 00:03:19.490
You know she hasn't.

00:03:21.870 --> 00:03:25.960
I shouldn't make everyone
worry more than I already have...

00:03:26.040 --> 00:03:29.000
I need to get it together,
especially at a time like this.

00:03:35.800 --> 00:03:39.180
So, you feel the same way about this, Father?

00:03:39.270 --> 00:03:43.310
I can guess that much, judging
from the way he's fought before.

00:03:43.390 --> 00:03:48.400
Are you saying that Age's trying to protect
the princess by making himself a target?

00:03:48.480 --> 00:03:51.570
Other than that, he wouldn't have any
reason to leave the ship, would he?

00:03:51.650 --> 00:03:56.490
That monkey isn't even aware that he's a hero.

00:03:56.570 --> 00:03:59.410
Captain, as a soldier, I'd
like to ask you a question.

00:03:59.490 --> 00:04:01.870
What's with the formality?

00:04:01.960 --> 00:04:07.500
Do you think it's appropriate to let the Yunos
family be in charge of Age and the fleet?

00:04:07.590 --> 00:04:11.550
We should not entrust our
future to those brothers!

00:04:11.630 --> 00:04:13.840
That's the Council's decision.

00:04:13.930 --> 00:04:19.930
Or do you know someone
who'd be better for the job?

00:04:20.010 --> 00:04:22.680
Princess Dhianeila, of course.

00:04:22.770 --> 00:04:25.770
But the princess is also a
member of the Yunos family.

00:04:25.850 --> 00:04:27.980
The princess is different from them.

00:04:28.060 --> 00:04:32.480
She's someone that the Nodos would
be willing to give his own life to protect!

00:04:32.570 --> 00:04:36.030
There's no other person like that.

00:04:36.110 --> 00:04:38.870
As a soldier who's commanding the
Argonaut on behalf of the Yunos family,

00:04:38.950 --> 00:04:41.540
I have no comment on that.

00:04:41.620 --> 00:04:46.120
But I feel the same way, too.

00:04:46.210 --> 00:04:47.830
Excuse me, sir.

00:04:52.380 --> 00:04:57.180
Create a private communication line
between me and Nilval on the Althaia.

00:04:57.260 --> 00:05:01.220
One the people in the fleet
can't intercept. Can you do it?

00:05:01.310 --> 00:05:04.890
I can set it up for you
within 70 minutes, Master.

00:05:04.980 --> 00:05:06.180
Get right to it then.

00:05:06.270 --> 00:05:08.730
Roger.

00:05:08.810 --> 00:05:10.440
I'd better hurry up...

00:05:18.110 --> 00:05:21.410
Descendants of humanity
spread all over this universe--

00:05:21.490 --> 00:05:27.080
Our ancestors once set out on a journey
into space in search of infinite possibilities!

00:05:27.170 --> 00:05:28.580
Many sacrifices have been made along the way,

00:05:28.670 --> 00:05:36.420
but we owe the prosperity humankind enjoys
in this universe today to their noble spirits!

00:05:36.510 --> 00:05:42.600
And the Tribe of Silver is trampling on them!

00:05:42.680 --> 00:05:45.270
Humans, now is the time for you to rise!

00:05:45.350 --> 00:05:47.270
We're going to reclaim
humankind's mother planet

00:05:47.350 --> 00:05:54.020
from the hands of the ruthless
and insatiable Tribe of Silver!

00:05:54.110 --> 00:05:56.570
This war is a holy war indeed!

00:05:56.650 --> 00:06:00.450
All humanity and all the planets of all
the tribes affiliated with the Federation

00:06:00.530 --> 00:06:05.490
must come together and never
waver in their cooperation!

00:06:06.700 --> 00:06:09.620
With all due respect, our star systems'
materials have been virtually seized

00:06:09.710 --> 00:06:13.130
from us in the name of the Federation fleet.

00:06:13.210 --> 00:06:16.960
It almost seems like they're
trying to put us under their control,

00:06:17.050 --> 00:06:18.840
instead of the Tribe of Silver!

00:06:18.930 --> 00:06:25.390
Please accept my deepest apology for
my brothers' forceful orders for supplies.

00:06:25.470 --> 00:06:27.970
The dignity of humankind
is at stake in this war.

00:06:28.060 --> 00:06:31.440
We have no other option but to win it.

00:06:31.520 --> 00:06:34.310
And in order to achieve that,
it is essential for all the planets

00:06:34.400 --> 00:06:40.530
to come together for the cause.
We must never use tyranny to gain support.

00:06:40.610 --> 00:06:43.320
I shall assume the role of
ambassador to this supportive alliance

00:06:43.410 --> 00:06:46.540
in place of my brothers on the front lines.

00:06:46.620 --> 00:06:49.000
I swear to you that we will
never again force assistance.

00:06:49.080 --> 00:06:52.830
That leads to mutual exhaustion
of resources and creates mistrust.

00:06:52.920 --> 00:06:56.670
Either way, once we go
up against the Tribe of Silver,

00:06:56.750 --> 00:06:59.880
no star system can dismiss
the issue as another's problem.

00:06:59.970 --> 00:07:04.340
Princess Dhianeila, it is hard not
to wish you were the one in charge

00:07:04.430 --> 00:07:08.010
on the front lines if we
all have to work together.

00:07:08.100 --> 00:07:10.060
It is very kind of you to say so.

00:07:13.150 --> 00:07:17.190
It is impossible to predict how many ant heaps
there are going to be, and in what formations.

00:07:17.280 --> 00:07:21.110
In other words, your flexible
response is going to be the key.

00:07:21.200 --> 00:07:24.870
For instance, in the case where--

00:07:24.950 --> 00:07:27.370
That's enough, Colonel. Oops, I'm sorry.

00:07:27.450 --> 00:07:32.250
I guess you're Lieutenant General Nilval now.

00:07:32.330 --> 00:07:37.840
My Quental Unit will take the
lead in this. We'll blow 'em all up!

00:07:37.920 --> 00:07:39.380
That is reckless.

00:07:39.460 --> 00:07:45.050
No, it's not! Quental Unit is a
dauntless unit with nothing but elites.

00:07:45.140 --> 00:07:48.050
Getting rid of those
little worms is an easy task.

00:07:48.140 --> 00:07:52.520
Then, please share with us the basic
battle strategies of the Calydonian Fleet.

00:07:52.600 --> 00:07:56.400
I told you that just now.
And besides, we have the Nodos.

00:07:56.480 --> 00:07:58.400
What if the enemy Nodos appear?

00:07:58.480 --> 00:08:00.570
Fight Nodos with Nodos, I say.

00:08:00.650 --> 00:08:03.280
Are you saying that you're going
to use the Nodos as the main force?

00:08:03.360 --> 00:08:06.280
I can't believe you're going to put
that much burden on one individual...

00:08:06.370 --> 00:08:07.910
--Nilval!
--Your Majesty.

00:08:07.990 --> 00:08:11.580
I was quite impressed with
how hard you fought at Huelgoat.

00:08:11.660 --> 00:08:14.080
You received an exceptional promotion
to lieutenant general and we invited you

00:08:14.170 --> 00:08:17.750
to our fleet as an assistant to
the executive tactical commander

00:08:17.840 --> 00:08:20.090
because we acknowledged
your distinguished war service.

00:08:20.170 --> 00:08:21.630
I'm very honored.

00:08:21.710 --> 00:08:27.300
That is why you must support Atalantes
with everything you've got! Understood?

00:08:27.390 --> 00:08:29.350
I'm aware of that, sir.

00:08:31.520 --> 00:08:32.770
They're nothing but damn monkeys,

00:08:32.850 --> 00:08:35.100
trying to act like military men,
using the power of military uniforms!

00:08:35.190 --> 00:08:38.190
It's pretty hopeless if we have
to play along with those people...

00:08:38.270 --> 00:08:39.900
Yes, ma'am...

00:08:40.530 --> 00:08:42.150
Nilval!

00:08:44.900 --> 00:08:47.070
And here comes the real monkey.

00:08:47.160 --> 00:08:49.950
But this is the monkey
who's going to save humanity.

00:08:50.030 --> 00:08:53.120
Mr. Savior, how can I help you?

00:08:53.200 --> 00:08:55.790
P-a-i-n-t!

00:08:55.870 --> 00:08:56.830
--Huh?
--Huh?

00:09:19.020 --> 00:09:20.650
Let's begin.

00:09:22.070 --> 00:09:29.360
The fifth Nodos and the Tribe of Iron...
About their existence and we ourselves...

00:09:30.410 --> 00:09:32.160
From representatives of the Orion Star System,

00:09:32.240 --> 00:09:36.000
the Council of the Colonis Star System,
the Logistic Mission Council...

00:09:36.080 --> 00:09:39.000
And that's just the beginning.
They're the symbols of friendship sent to you

00:09:39.080 --> 00:09:41.750
by many representatives of
many planets, Dhianeila-sama.

00:09:41.840 --> 00:09:43.840
There are so many of them...

00:09:43.920 --> 00:09:45.170
Besides flowers and jewelry,

00:09:45.260 --> 00:09:48.760
we have small-sized boats and
supplies stacked up on the dock as well.

00:09:48.840 --> 00:09:51.180
It goes to show that even the
behind-the-lines star systems

00:09:51.260 --> 00:09:54.760
have responded to your
initiative, Dhianeila-sama.

00:09:54.850 --> 00:09:57.730
Please send my sincere thanks to everyone.

00:09:57.810 --> 00:10:02.270
I'm going to give the goods that I've received
to the soldiers as rewards for their hard work.

00:10:02.360 --> 00:10:05.730
She should just keep them for herself...

00:10:05.820 --> 00:10:11.280
I suppose this shows just how
high expectations are for this war.

00:10:11.370 --> 00:10:12.820
You're mistaken, Princess.

00:10:12.910 --> 00:10:14.870
I think it is you that
everyone has high expectations of.

00:10:14.950 --> 00:10:19.910
You discovered a path in a place with no
starway and succeeded in the Nodos search--

00:10:23.920 --> 00:10:28.550
Please don't push yourself any harder
than you already have, Dhianeila-sama.

00:10:30.970 --> 00:10:32.550
This is something else!

00:10:32.640 --> 00:10:37.180
The relay is so clear I can't believe it's a
secret line hidden in the fleet's I.D. signals.

00:10:37.270 --> 00:10:42.900
It's all thanks to my right hand, the
main A.I. of the Argonaut, Bee no Bee.

00:10:42.980 --> 00:10:46.610
So, about the plan for
the fleet reorganization...

00:10:46.690 --> 00:10:48.610
I've already sent you the data.

00:10:48.690 --> 00:10:50.320
That's what I'm talking about!

00:10:50.400 --> 00:10:55.410
I'm itching to seize authority from
those brothers as soon as possible,

00:10:55.490 --> 00:11:00.080
but I learned at Huelgoat
that I'm not cut out for that.

00:11:00.160 --> 00:11:02.620
I'd like to see your princess stand up for it.

00:11:02.710 --> 00:11:06.090
The calls for her to do so
are getting louder every day.

00:11:06.170 --> 00:11:08.420
However, the princess is still young.

00:11:08.510 --> 00:11:11.260
And she's been trying to
suppress her quality as a leader

00:11:11.340 --> 00:11:12.760
and present her brothers in a good light.

00:11:12.840 --> 00:11:15.930
You can't afford to sit back
and wait for her to wake up.

00:11:16.010 --> 00:11:22.850
We'll have everything ready just in case.
By the way, how's our wayward Mr. Hero?

00:11:22.940 --> 00:11:26.230
"P-a-i-n-t," he says.

00:11:53.720 --> 00:11:56.010
Enemies destroyed. Zero remaining.

00:11:57.300 --> 00:11:59.600
All units, return to the Argonaut.

00:12:08.520 --> 00:12:11.070
Everyone's response speed is dropping!

00:12:11.150 --> 00:12:13.700
Feeling listless because you've
been away from the real battles?

00:12:13.780 --> 00:12:17.160
Be sure to fix that problem before
the next training session! Understood?

00:12:17.240 --> 00:12:18.870
Yes, sir!

00:12:21.910 --> 00:12:25.370
You're always pretty strict, huh?

00:12:25.460 --> 00:12:26.960
It's to keep their fighting spirits high.

00:12:27.040 --> 00:12:31.340
Even though the Argonaut's
been assigned to rear support?

00:12:31.420 --> 00:12:34.380
Why don't you relax a little?

00:12:34.470 --> 00:12:37.680
Age kept on fighting at the very rear.

00:12:37.760 --> 00:12:41.180
He doesn't even think about
distinguishing himself in battle.

00:12:41.270 --> 00:12:46.350
That's exactly why he was able to keep
on fighting for hundreds of hours all alone.

00:12:46.440 --> 00:12:49.310
Are you trying to compete against the Nodos?

00:12:49.400 --> 00:12:50.690
The Nodos?

00:12:50.780 --> 00:12:53.690
No. Against Age! The way he fought

00:12:53.780 --> 00:12:58.030
is deeply engraved in the heart of
every single member of the knight unit!

00:12:58.120 --> 00:13:00.740
I'm sure it's not a big deal to you, though.

00:13:00.830 --> 00:13:03.540
No, it's not like that at all.

00:13:03.620 --> 00:13:06.540
Let me stop interrupting your work.

00:13:06.620 --> 00:13:07.830
Thanks for this.

00:13:07.920 --> 00:13:09.880
You're welcome.

00:13:20.600 --> 00:13:25.520
I thought it'd be a more cheerful
looking picture, but it looks so creepy...

00:13:25.600 --> 00:13:28.520
What did he draw exactly?

00:13:28.600 --> 00:13:30.520
It's what Age heard from Dad and the others.

00:13:30.610 --> 00:13:32.570
"Dad and the others"?

00:13:32.650 --> 00:13:35.400
Dhianeila calls them the Tribe of Gold.

00:13:35.490 --> 00:13:36.400
What...

00:13:36.490 --> 00:13:37.740
Tribe of...

00:13:37.820 --> 00:13:39.450
Gold...

00:13:44.080 --> 00:13:45.120
A star?

00:13:45.200 --> 00:13:50.420
Oh, I get it! He must've drawn
the end of the Tribe of Silver!

00:13:50.500 --> 00:13:54.250
I see! I guess that's the
destruction and despair

00:13:54.340 --> 00:13:56.670
the Tribe of Silver is about to face, huh?

00:13:56.760 --> 00:13:59.260
We can use this, Big Brother.

00:13:59.340 --> 00:14:00.930
What do you mean?

00:14:01.010 --> 00:14:06.180
This proves that the
Tribe of Gold predicted our victory!

00:14:06.270 --> 00:14:09.690
We should definitely use this picture for PR!

00:14:09.770 --> 00:14:12.770
Hmm. After seeing this picture,
everyone's going to see we've been

00:14:12.860 --> 00:14:18.820
promised the future and be
eager to give a helping hand, huh?

00:14:21.280 --> 00:14:23.240
We want you to keep on drawing!

00:14:23.330 --> 00:14:25.290
We should consider donating
the pictures to each colonial planet

00:14:25.370 --> 00:14:28.330
in the name of the Yunos Royal Family, too!

00:14:28.410 --> 00:14:31.790
--Nilval, we put you in charge of his pictures.
--Yes, sir.

00:14:31.880 --> 00:14:35.340
I don't care how many
materials you request for him.

00:14:37.170 --> 00:14:39.470
So that's how it is,
I'm in charge of pictures now?

00:14:39.550 --> 00:14:43.430
Putting their random interpretations
aside, what exactly are you drawing?

00:14:43.510 --> 00:14:44.430
The future.

00:14:44.510 --> 00:14:45.720
Whose?

00:14:45.810 --> 00:14:48.430
The place Age is heading.

00:14:49.890 --> 00:14:52.850
Then, what's that light?

00:14:54.230 --> 00:14:56.650
Dhianeila.

00:14:56.730 --> 00:15:02.700
Because Dhianeila is the light that finds
everyone's path, even in the dark sky.

00:15:02.780 --> 00:15:06.830
Did you leave the Argonaut
in order to protect this light

00:15:06.910 --> 00:15:09.370
that's shining in the midst of destruction?

00:15:09.460 --> 00:15:11.460
It's dangerous to be with Age.

00:15:11.540 --> 00:15:15.130
When is this light going to lead us?

00:15:15.210 --> 00:15:17.840
--When the planet dies.
--What?

00:15:17.920 --> 00:15:22.430
The important planet will die
and Dhianeila will get really sad.

00:15:22.510 --> 00:15:24.140
What's the name of the planet?

00:15:24.220 --> 00:15:25.850
Dunno.

00:15:36.770 --> 00:15:41.530
The Tribe of Iron and
us will be able to coexist.

00:15:41.610 --> 00:15:46.370
No. They're unstable
beings controlled by emotions.

00:15:46.450 --> 00:15:50.660
We'll have to destroy them before
they bring harm to this universe.

00:15:50.750 --> 00:15:54.290
And to do that, we will
send off multiple Nodos.

00:15:54.380 --> 00:15:59.670
It would bring chaos if more than one
Nodos were to fight at the same time.

00:15:59.760 --> 00:16:02.670
The chaos of Nodos is destruction indeed.

00:16:02.760 --> 00:16:05.390
The fight against the fifth
Nodos is in the agreements,

00:16:05.470 --> 00:16:09.220
established by our father,
in the Tribe of Gold.

00:16:09.310 --> 00:16:11.060
It's unavoidable.

00:16:11.140 --> 00:16:13.850
What if we lose our Nodos?

00:16:13.940 --> 00:16:15.270
We'll leave Yuty.

00:16:15.350 --> 00:16:18.560
It is also mentioned in the agreements
that the other Nodos shall protect Yuty,

00:16:18.650 --> 00:16:22.280
who's a member of the Tribe of Silver.

00:16:27.320 --> 00:16:30.700
I agree to destroy the Tribe of Iron.

00:16:30.790 --> 00:16:33.750
We will send off multiple Nodos
and hope to settle the matter.

00:16:36.420 --> 00:16:39.290
Phaetho, I sense that you're disturbed.

00:16:39.380 --> 00:16:41.340
I've eliminated lowly emotions.

00:16:47.340 --> 00:16:53.310
We must make flowers bloom on
Age's home planet of Olone, too, one day.

00:16:54.810 --> 00:16:56.390
Dhianeila-sama?

00:16:56.480 --> 00:17:00.110
I feel it... The fighting
spirits of the fleet rising...

00:17:00.190 --> 00:17:01.520
That means...

00:17:01.610 --> 00:17:05.320
The battle has begun.

00:17:05.400 --> 00:17:07.360
All fleets, fire the main cannons!

00:17:12.330 --> 00:17:15.960
Stay close together and focus the
firepower on the enemy's advance force!

00:17:16.040 --> 00:17:17.790
Cease fire!

00:17:17.880 --> 00:17:19.500
Look at that.

00:17:50.990 --> 00:17:53.790
Belcross... So he's started moving.

00:17:53.870 --> 00:17:55.870
It's begun.

00:17:55.950 --> 00:18:01.830
Do you think more than one of us
will end up going to fight against him?

00:18:01.920 --> 00:18:07.090
If more than two members of the Tribe
of Hero fought, it could cause madness.

00:18:07.170 --> 00:18:10.680
And if that were to happen,
it would lead to unthinkable destruction.

00:18:10.760 --> 00:18:14.140
Because of that, the Tribe of Silver
hasn't been able to make a decision yet.

00:18:14.220 --> 00:18:19.020
I'm willing to face the madness if that's
what we need to do to defeat the fifth one.

00:18:19.100 --> 00:18:21.770
After all, that is the
agreement which was given to me.

00:18:21.860 --> 00:18:24.360
But if you do that, many planets will die.

00:18:24.440 --> 00:18:28.950
I want you to destroy Lernaea
and me before that happens.

00:18:29.030 --> 00:18:32.660
But we don't want to do that...

00:18:37.830 --> 00:18:40.120
That's the battle footage from three days ago.

00:18:40.210 --> 00:18:43.380
So the officials put together this video

00:18:43.460 --> 00:18:45.380
to show off the brilliant
results of the battle, huh?

00:18:45.460 --> 00:18:47.210
Obviously they're retaining military
strength by using Age as a shield.

00:18:47.300 --> 00:18:49.920
I knew this was going to happen, but...

00:19:07.990 --> 00:19:10.740
Attention all forces!

00:19:10.820 --> 00:19:14.780
We, the Calydonian Fleet,
just reached the solar system!

00:19:17.120 --> 00:19:19.750
The planet of the ancient god, Jupiter...

00:19:27.340 --> 00:19:30.670
Finally, we have returned!

00:19:30.760 --> 00:19:33.720
To the solar system, the home of all humankind!

00:19:36.350 --> 00:19:38.310
Many enemy ant heaps approaching!

00:19:43.230 --> 00:19:44.350
It's huge...

00:19:44.440 --> 00:19:48.270
That's the biggest one so far. Both its
offensive and defensive power are unknown!

00:19:48.360 --> 00:19:50.110
Those little worms!

00:19:50.190 --> 00:19:53.150
We won't let them do
whatever they want in our home!

00:19:53.240 --> 00:19:57.780
Big Brother, order my
Quental Unit to move out!

00:19:57.870 --> 00:20:01.790
There's no need for that. We'll
let our Mr. Savior handle them.

00:20:01.870 --> 00:20:03.330
But, Big Brother!

00:20:03.420 --> 00:20:06.250
It'll damage the Yunos family's reputation
if we just sit around and do nothing!

00:20:06.340 --> 00:20:10.340
Atalantes, do you know what's
missing from the Yunos family?

00:20:10.420 --> 00:20:12.050
Huh?

00:20:34.910 --> 00:20:39.490
The Yunos family has fortune and
fame, but something's missing...

00:20:39.580 --> 00:20:41.160
...a legend!

00:20:41.250 --> 00:20:45.500
If we manage to win this holy war
without shedding a single drop of blood,

00:20:45.580 --> 00:20:51.590
we will surely go down in history as the
family that was chosen by the Tribe of Gold!

00:20:51.670 --> 00:20:56.590
It's a legend that shows the Yunos family
is the leading power of the entire universe!

00:20:56.680 --> 00:20:59.850
The Nodos is nothing but a tool for that!

00:20:59.930 --> 00:21:02.100
How brilliant!

00:21:02.180 --> 00:21:03.810
Ridiculous...

00:21:13.740 --> 00:21:14.900
Age...

00:21:17.110 --> 00:21:19.070
We have made a decision.

00:21:23.660 --> 00:21:24.870
They made the decision.

00:21:24.960 --> 00:21:26.620
More than one of you will go.

00:21:26.710 --> 00:21:27.960
I'll go.

00:21:28.040 --> 00:21:29.790
Lecty.

00:21:29.880 --> 00:21:32.380
I'm going, too.

00:21:32.460 --> 00:21:34.090
Why?

00:21:36.550 --> 00:21:40.430
All three of you go.
Karkinos and Lecty will fight him.

00:21:40.510 --> 00:21:43.680
If that's not good enough,
Mehitak will join you.

00:21:43.770 --> 00:21:48.390
Don't worry. I'll stop whoever goes mad.

00:22:25.350 --> 00:22:30.270
Although I have known you for a long time

00:22:30.350 --> 00:22:40.910
l never dreamed these feelings would sprout

00:22:40.990 --> 00:22:46.080
And I would fall in love with you

00:22:46.160 --> 00:22:56.960
Casually going home,
as I look at the stars in the night sky

00:22:57.050 --> 00:23:09.640
l take the long way on purpose
and lean on your shoulder as we walk

00:23:09.730 --> 00:23:20.860
You tell me you think we can overcome
anything as long as we stay together

00:23:20.950 --> 00:23:26.200
I think as I look into your forthright eyes

00:23:26.280 --> 00:23:32.920
That I love you

00:23:36.630 --> 00:23:40.340
Their foolish behavior enrages the stars.

00:23:40.420 --> 00:23:44.390
Next time on Heroic Age,
Episode 12: "The Torch of Destruction."
